  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EU Twinning Migrationsverket Serbien II, fas 1b</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Twinning Swedish Migration Agency Serbia II, phase 1b - EU Twinning Swedish Migration Agency Serbia, phase 1b</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Migrationsverket har utarbetat och presenterat sitt projektf&#xf6;rlag inom ramen f&#xf6;r EU Twinning fiche &quot;Support to strengthening migration&#xa0;management and asylum system i Serbia - SR 16 IPA JH 02 18&quot; med st&#xf6;d fr&#xe5;n Sida f&#xf6;r sina omkostnader i denna process.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Migrationsverket ans&#xf6;ker om st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r Fas 1b, utarbetande och presentation av Twinningf&#xf6;rslag inom ramen f&#xf6;r EU Twinning projektet Support to strengthening migration management and asylum system in Serbia med nummer SR 16 IPA JH 02 18.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish Migration Agency is applying for financial support to work out a proposal to the EU Twinning project Support to strengthening migration management and asylum system in Serbia with the number SR 16 IPA JH 02 18.</narrative>
  </description>
